    <string name="cal_explain_title">How the calendar is worked out</string>
    <string name="cal_explain_body">Your device works out the Sun and Moon positions for your city and finds which tithi and nakshatra hold at sunrise on each day. Festival dates follow written rules. Nothing leaves your phone.</string>
